Get model details

Usage: vendo models get [OPTIONS] <modelId>

Arguments:
  <modelId>  

Options:
      --json            Output raw JSON
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo models get <modelId>
  $ vendo models get <modelId> --json
